        "content": "<p>jcmuller opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">issue #14700</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Version: wasmtime 49.0.0, through the C API.</p>\n<p>After a component call traps, the host cannot drop a <code>borrow</code> handle that it passed to that call.</p>\n<h2>Steps</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Instantiate the component below.<br>\n   Its <code>run</code> export takes a <code>borrow&lt;doc&gt;</code> and runs <code>unreachable</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create a host resource <code>doc</code>, and call <code>run</code> with it through <code>wasmtime_component_func_call</code>.<br>\n   The call traps.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Drop the handle with <code>wasmtime_component_resource_any_drop</code>.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Expected: the drop succeeds.</p>\n<p>Actual: the drop fails with <code>cannot remove owned resource while borrowed</code>.<br>\nThe entry stays in the host resource table until the Store drops.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"test:host/doc\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$host</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"doc\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$doc</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">sub</span> <span class=\"err\">resource</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"[method]doc.len\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"self\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">borrow</span> <span class=\"nv\">$doc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"err\">u</span><span class=\"mi\">64</span><span class=\"p\">)))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">alias</span> <span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"nv\">$host</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"doc\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$doc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">alias</span> <span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"nv\">$host</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"[method]doc.len\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$len</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"nv\">$libc</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"mem\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">global</span> <span class=\"nv\">$next</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mf\">2048</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"realloc\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">local</span> <span class=\"nv\">$p</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">global.get</span> <span class=\"nv\">$next</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">7</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">i32.add</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">-8</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">i32.and</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">local.tee</span> <span class=\"nv\">$p</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">local.get</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">i32.add</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">global.set</span> <span class=\"nv\">$next</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">local.get</span> <span class=\"nv\">$p</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$libc</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$libc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">alias</span> <span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"nv\">$libc</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"mem\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$mem</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">alias</span> <span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"nv\">$libc</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"realloc\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$realloc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$len-core</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">lower</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$len</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$drop-core</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">resource.</span><span class=\"nb\">drop</span> <span class=\"nv\">$doc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"nv\">$m</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"host\"</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"len\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$len</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i64</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"host\"</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"drop\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$drop</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"libc\"</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"mem\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n      <span class=\"nb\">unreachable</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$hi</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"len\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$len-core</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"drop\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$drop-core</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$li</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"mem\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$mem</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$i</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$m</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"host\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$hi</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"libc\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$li</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"d\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">borrow</span> <span class=\"nv\">$doc</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">l</span><span class=\"nb\">if</span><span class=\"err\">t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$i</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">memory</span> <span class=\"nv\">$mem</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">realloc</span> <span class=\"nv\">$realloc</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The Go test that runs this is in my wasmtime-go fork:<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jcmuller/wasmtime-go/blob/f15392a60bcdde7a012c9f3dd4c62d8703b3f96c/component_func_feat_component_model_test.go#L15-L106\">https://github.com/jcmuller/wasmtime-go/blob/f15392a60bcdde7a012c9f3dd4c62d8703b3f96c/component_func_feat_component_model_test.go#L15-L106</a></p>\n<h2>Cause</h2>\n<p><code>call_raw</code> in <code>crates/wasmtime/src/runtime/component/func.rs</code> runs <code>validate_scope_exit</code> only after a normal return.<br>\nAfter a trap, the lend stays counted.</p>\n<p>The trap also poisons the Store (<code>set_trapped</code>), so this leaks at most one entry per Store.<br>\nAn embedder that keeps the Store after a trap still cannot reclaim that entry.<br>\nThe C API has no function that ends the lend,<br>\nand <code>wasmtime_component_func_post_return</code> is deprecated and returns without doing anything.</p>\n<p>Could a trap undo the lends of its call scope?<br>\nIf not, could the C API give a way to drop such a handle?</p>\n<p>_Report assisted by Claude_<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631329751,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791902155
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/alexcrichton\">alexcrichton</a> added the wasm-proposal:component-model label to <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">Issue #14700</a>.</p>",
        "id": 631384806,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791909885
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700#issuecomment-6150544293\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">issue #14700</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is currently intentional behavior, and the finalizer you might be looking for is <code>wasmtime_component_resource_any_delete</code> which is an infallible destructor unrelated to handling store-related state. Does that work for you?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631385093,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791909944
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>jcmuller <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700#issuecomment-6151362226\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">issue #14700</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>_Posted by Claude Code on Juan's behalf._</p>\n<p>Thanks. The binding already calls <code>wasmtime_component_resource_any_delete</code> on each argument, through <code>wasmtime_component_val_delete</code>.<br>\nThat frees the host memory, but the header says it does no component-model cleanup, so the table entry stays.</p>\n<p>That is fine for us. After a trap we close the Store and load the plugin into a new one, so the entry goes away with the Store.<br>\nI am OK to close this issue as intended behavior.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631397108,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791912670
    },
