        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700#issuecomment-6151405591\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">issue #14700</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Posted by Claude Code on Juan's behalf.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>@jcmuller I've hidden your latest comment as spam. Please follow our <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/governance/blob/main/AI_TOOL_POLICY.md\">AI tool usage policy</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631397767,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
