    {
        "content": "<p>jcmuller <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700#issuecomment-6151433920\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14700\">issue #14700</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>@alexcrichton sorry about that. Closing this as it's intended behavior.</p>\n</blockquote>",
